# The steps tests/extera.env's run takes (mac-host --script): seconds from the start, then the step. Coordinates are in the
# 1080x2400 frame, with an iPhone's insets (HOST_ARGS). With the HUSK_BOT_TOKEN secret the app logs in to that bot's account by
# itself, on its first start (tests/plugins/husk_bot_login.plugin), and shows it from the next. Its first chat: opened, scrolled
# back twice, closed.
8 shot intro
12 shot main
13 tap 540 590
20 shot chat1
21 swipe 540 900 540 1900
24 shot chat1-older
25 swipe 540 900 540 1900
28 shot chat1-older2
31 back
34 shot list
44 shot end
